  "title": "C-Suite insights: Unlocking ROI with MES and ERP in food manufacturing",
  "summary": "Most food processors running an ERP believe they have solid financial visibility with procurement, accounts payable, invoicing, and inventory all accessible. Which is why the instinctive response from finance leadership to the suggestion to add a Manufacturing Execution System (MES), is predictable: we already have a system. The response is understandable, but ERP alone, or ERP and MES systems that don’t work together, can result in significantly reduced ROI.",
